DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43122::$$$message_0359_0000_0000$$$::"Good grief. What a disaster."::
43123::$$$message_0359_0000_0001$$$::"Mm-hm. Restrain yourself in the future."::
43124::$$$message_0359_0000_0002$$$::"Y-yes, of course![lr]::
43125::$$$message_0359_0000_0003$$$::...I'm so sorry. I didn't mean to cause you trouble, Souichirou."::
43126::$$$message_0359_0000_0004$$$::"Mm."::
43127::$$$message_0359_0000_0005$$$::"By the way...this is my first time in a mixed bath...do I look all right?"::
43128::$$$message_0359_0000_0006$$$::"Well, Caster, my glasses have fogged up, so I can't see."::
43129::$$$message_0359_0000_0007$$$::"What a shame. Baths like these have a charm you can't experience normally."::
43130::$$$message_0359_0000_0008$$$::"Assassin! Why did you come all the way in here with us!?"::
43131::$$$message_0359_0000_0009$$$::"What an odd question."::
43132::$$$message_0359_0001_0000$$$::"You released me from my bond to the gate, and now I'm attached to Souichirou's glasses."::
43133::$$$message_0359_0001_0001$$$::"Hm."::
43134::$$$message_0359_0001_0002$$$::"Then I'll take these glasses and put them somewhere far[line len=2]"::
43135::$$$message_0359_0001_0003$$$::"Oh, are you sure about that? The towel covering your body might come loose."::
43136::$$$message_0359_0001_0004$$$::"W-w-w-what did you just say, you phony samurai!?"::
43137::$$$message_0359_0001_0005$$$::"Besides, I could have simply stayed invisible, but that wouldn't fit the refined, liberating atmosphere of this bathhouse."::
43138::$$$message_0359_0002_0000$$$::"I hope the fact that I've revealed myself proves my sincerity."::
43139::$$$message_0359_0002_0001$$$::"...Hmph.[lr]::
43140::$$$message_0359_0002_0002$$$::Have you ever heard of tact? It's something you should learn to exercise around me and Souichirou."::
43141::$$$message_0359_0002_0003$$$::"What do you mean? I'm not here because I want to be. Need I remind you who dragged me along on this outing?"::
43142::$$$message_0359_0002_0004$$$::"Rrrgh! You do so get on my nerves![lr]::
43143::$$$message_0359_0002_0005$$$::Go switch places with Saber, [hfchance layer=1]you lanky samurai!"::
43144::$$$message_0359_0002_0006$$$::"...Mm. This is a good bath."::Á®